{"3460540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cardtographer", "steam_appid": 3460540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of multi-champion warfare, alone or in Coop Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each of your 4 heroes brings unique cards and abilities — combine their strengths to overcome their weaknesses.   <br>Select your Dream Team to combine their abilities.  <br>Collect more and more cards and build powerful decks to lead one or more champions to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to each playthrough, as randomly generated maps and events force you to make tough decisions. <br>Earn gold, items, and new cards in exciting battles and encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new allies, make sacrifices at ancient sites,  raid camps for resources or help the desperate inhabitants of the world - the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful as you push deeper into a dangerous world, not everything is as it seems at first glance. <br>Your success depends on combining cards in the best possible way and reacting to an ever-changing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflect your tactical decisions all the time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460540/extras/356f6327367d278466baa319c76a00e8.webp?t=1788187400\" width=165 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose from 4 unique champion classes</strong>, each with their own deck, combat type and multiple <strong>play styles</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock and master</strong> over 230 Cards across multiple champion skills. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill Bosses</strong> to reach the highest Card Upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with 1, 2, 3 or 4 champions and</strong> combine their strengths to cover their weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many map events</strong> with meaningful <strong>choices</strong> and <strong>consequences</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated world maps</strong> deliver <strong>always new adventures</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack </strong>which fits the mood.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460540/extras/f2da275c98712246fe01007e54347c5e.webp?t=1788187400\" width=450 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460540/extras/9611d61af5e44ad9743306ef2feadede.poster.avif?t=1788187400\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460540/extras/9611d61af5e44ad9743306ef2feadede.webm?t=1788187400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460540/extras/9611d61af5e44ad9743306ef2feadede.mp4?t=1788187400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460540/extras/7210732dfec525fa5b960d14d1a7302f.webp?t=1788187400\" width=450 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460540/extras/641b567e7e6c9a15935bfb029251da83.poster.avif?t=1788187400\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta